<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.7849 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.7849 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7849 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.7400 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 25		 July 24</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.8500</p>
<p> Low				75.6000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Open			     75.8000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.7849		 75.7400</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     1.710		   1.700</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
